WEBVTT

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.940
<b>Kishuu Province, Wakayama Castle</b>

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.990
<i>Shogun Yoshimune has sent</i>

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.450
<i>a message that the Princess 
is on her way to Kishuu.</i>

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.020
She's going to the well?

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.340
My lord!

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:46.830
My lord...

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.340
It's dangerous to be outside, my lord.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:01.970
It's fine.

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:03.870
This is where I must be.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:06.670
Be not afraid, people of Kishuu.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.120
We have not come to fight.

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.480
My name is Sanada Yukimura.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:16.490
I have come to meet Kishuu's lord, 
Tokugawa Munenao.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.570
Y-You are Yukimura?

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.780
A ghost from a century past, 
reappearing as an Insect-man?

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:30.830
<b>The Cool Guy in Glasses
 Lectures on Right and Wrong</b>

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.840
<b>East Sea Road, Enshuu Province</b>

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:39.650
Look how far Mt. Fuji is...

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.480
Miss!

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.220
Servant of the Insect Magistrate,

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.570
please wait!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.180
Uh, where are we going?

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:52.300
We're getting far from Edo.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.230
I have my job in Edo...

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.240
This is part of your job.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.890
Part of it...

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.800
You cannot return to Edo for a while.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.230
Tsukishima,

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:07.490
you will accompany me to Kishuu Province.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.350
Wh-What?!

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.120
I'm going to Kishuu Province?

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:15.000
Um, where is Kishuu Province?

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:16.630
You'll know when you arrive.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:20.220
Then, why are we going to Kishuu Province?

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.460
Wrong.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:24.350
Huh?

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.120
A mere attendant has no right to know.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.210
Um, miss...

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.690
Is that the Insect Magistrate?

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.100
The Insect Magistrate?

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:35.810
Yes...

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:42.110
His style isn't quite what I had 
expected of the Magistrate.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.360
But I thought I should I ask.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.990
That is not the Magistrate.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.690
He is Oooka Echizen no Kamitadasuke, 
of the Edo Southtown Magistrate's.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.250
A brilliant man, heavily involved in city policy.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.920
He's said to be the smartest man in Edo.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.010
I can hear you,

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:01.510
miss...

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.660
I apologize.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.110
Do not allow it to concern you.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:10.800
I merely obey the Shogun's orders 
to protect you on your journey.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.020
I apologize for not introducing myself!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:18.020
I am Tsukishima Jinbei, of the 
Insect Magistrate City Patrol!

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:20.780
Let me see it.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:22.650
See what?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.190
U-Uh, what do you mean?

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.160
Let's go.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.430
We're wasting time.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.170
I am Tokugawa Munenao.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.050
Let's hear your demands.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.170
What are you after, Sanada?

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.420
I desire a ship.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.430
I want you to create a huge ship, one that can carry

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.180
A huge ship?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.830
Kishuu has excellent wood

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.570
and men who know how to work it.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.380
Look at this.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.450
This is a modified version of the warship

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.070
Oda Nobunaga originally proposed.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.220
I personally altered the plans.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.970
An invincible battleship that could easily defeat

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:18.480
tens of thousands of Shogunate ships...

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.250
If you give me this ship,

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.640
we will leave at once.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.760
That is all you want?

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.680
All?

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.770
A strange question...

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:40.290
What else could we want from 
a frontier castle like this?

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.300
Correct, Lord Munenao?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.780
I shall order the ship.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.830
And in exchange, you will not 
harm the people of Kishuu?

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:58.330
I, Sanada Yukimura, have never 
gone back on my word.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.580
What will happen to Kishuu?

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:06.720
M-Munenao-sama?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.130
Be at ease, men!

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:10.970
Kishuu is safe!

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.470
<b>Iseya Inn</b>

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.680
<i>It took a while, but we reached an inn.</i>

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.940
<i>I look forward to tomorrow.</i>

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.520
That's wrong, Tsukishima-dono.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.260
Oh?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.650
Oooka-dono, I was just walking...

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.240
No matter what path you travel,

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:08.330
a samurai should walk on the left.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:10.000
If you should pass another samurai that way,

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.240
your swords could collide.

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:19.730
If that happened, it could start 
a fight that would end lives.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:21.680
Right!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.330
A true samurai should avoid 
unnecessary combat.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.370
Be careful.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:30.340
Understood, Oooka-dono!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.510
Are you in trouble?

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:36.560
I shall help you!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.980
Thank you, samurai!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.220
You saved us...

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:50.530
No need for thanks.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.690
Wrong.

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.870
Why?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:01.080
What if those two had attacked the servant?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.610
But those two could never—

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.010
You cannot lower your guard.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.270
They say that if a samurai rolls up the carpet,

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:12.940
No matter the circumstance, you must

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:18.350
Yes, sir! Understood!

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:20.380
Yahoo!

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:21.070
Wrong.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.860
Fishies!

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:23.500
Wrong.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.190
It's shaking...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.610
Very wrong!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.320
Tsukishima-dono!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.240
As I thought, you are not the 
right person for this job.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.480
Wh-What?

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.830
Oooka...

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.820
I'm sorry, miss.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:42.000
But this mission is covert, 
and it is a critical one.

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:48.970
It must not fail because of 
your follower's indiscretion.

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.740
If he does anything else wrong,

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.630
I'd like him to return to Edo immediately.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.380
<i>As a samurai, I would be greatly shamed</i>

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.600
<i>to be sent back when we've 
nearly reached Kishuu...</i>

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.260
Understood, Oooka-dono!

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.640
I shall do all I can to meet your expectations!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.520
What a mess...

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.280
What should we do?

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:13.830
Tsukishima-dono...

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.450
R-Right!

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:19.400
No, no one's going through.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.950
Why is that?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.270
No reason!

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:24.080
Now get lost!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:27.280
But we have the note to allow us into Kishuu,

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:29.710
and everything else that is required!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.440
No... Begone!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.020
Excuse me.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.450
Call the master of this place.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:44.150
I am Oooka Tadasuke, 
of the Edo Southtown Magistrate's.

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:47.530
A secret letter from Shogun Tokugawa

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:49.830
regarding our arrival should 
have already come.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.730
If you do not let us through at once,

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:57.490
everyone at this station will be forced
to cut open their stomachs.

00:09:58.350 --> 00:09:59.750
Shut up!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.110
We've been ordered by the 
lord of this province

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.660
Munenao-sama, to let none pass!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.920
Munenao-sama said that?

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:11.630
<i>This is the right thing to do.</i>

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:16.150
<i>No matter how the Shogun may punish me,</i>

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.730
<i>I cannot allow the Princess here,</i>

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.190
<i>
 so long as Sanada Yukimura is in Kishuu...</i>

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:27.390
It appears something unpleasant 
is happening in Kishuu.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:29.030
Indeed.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:32.300
Is there any other way into Kishuu?

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:47.910
O-Oooka-dono, will crossing this 
cliff really take us into Kishuu?

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:48.590
Yes.

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:50.780
I'm amazed you knew this.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.440
Naturally...

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.750
You must be prepared for any contingency.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:59.160
But this is extremely dangerous...

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:03.580
Are you really okay on your own, miss?

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.690
I'll help you if you'd like.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.940
I appreciate the sentiment,

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.730
but you needn't worry about—

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.250
Ah!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:11.670
...me.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.650
Miss!

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.550
Yes, I'm fine.

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:20.540
I'm glad you're safe...

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:25.430
Tsukishima, you do not have to do this.

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:27.330
I'm all right on my own.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.830
No, you're not!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.550
Please be quiet and hang on tightly!

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.850
Is something wrong?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.010
It's nothing.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.330
It's only that you're more like you

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.770
when you act like yourself.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.270
H-Huh?

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.680
Is that the second gate?

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:01.590
Yes.

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:04.030
So what do we do now?

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:06.520
We head for Wakayama Castle.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.160
Wakayama Castle?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.660
Yes, what I need lies there.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:16.490
Who's there?

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:17.530
What are you doing here?

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:18.470
Uh-oh...

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:19.210
We're getting out of here.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.590
Everyone! Intruders!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.110
Get them!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.110
They went this way!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.590
That's far enough!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.040
They just keep coming.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.230
We have no choice.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.650
He drew his sword!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.600
Does he want to fight?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:32.980
Tsukishima.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.000
Tsukishima-dono...

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.100
This is pointless.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.030
Don't worry...

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:39.300
Koikawa-dono taught me this.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.240
This tree is a mere toothpick!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.850
Did we lose them?

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.570
Find them!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:54.430
They must be nearby!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.510
There are a lot of them.

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:01.890
Let us wait until night.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.090
We'll cross the second post in the dark.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.700
Wh-Who are you?

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.850
Are you with the intruders?!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:18.350
Say something...

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:19.200
Forget it!

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:19.980
Grab him!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.600
Impertinent.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.740
H-How—

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.800
Be quiet.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.950
Humans are as useless as expected.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.880
They cannot protect a single post?

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:48.160
My name is Nedzu Jinpachi, 
of the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.640
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Nedzu Jinpachi</b>

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.260
Show yourselves, rats.

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.580
I can sense your presence.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:57.350
You won't get away with this...

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:00.520
I won't let you!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.160
Wrong.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.630
You must not let your feelings

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:06.860
We must run.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:10.210
Oooka-dono, these are not 
my feelings talking!

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:13.870
He kills people! He is evil!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.500
Unless I defeat him, I would 
be neglecting my duty!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.100
Tsukishima-dono,

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.380
what if something were to 
happen to the servant?

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:30.920
Rats, I will kill you.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:39.310
You bastard, you killed them all!

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:46.940
Oooka-dono, I shall slow this Insect-man.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.530
Insect-man?

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:51.280
Take the servant, and get to Kishuu!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.230
You cannot abandon your task here.

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:56.310
That is very wrong.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.200
I do not mind, Tsukishima.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.640
Do as you will.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.290
Miss...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.260
Have no fear...

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:05.630
Defeat him.

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.220
I allow it!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.040
Very well!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.980
I will not let you escape.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.900
<i>Neck... Head... Side.</i>

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.600
<i>His strikes are so swift,</i>

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.790
<i>and they aim only for vital points.</i>

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:46.750
<i>He is a master of combat.</i>

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:52.340
<i>Far stronger than Sarutobi Sasuke!</i>

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.470
It's been a long time.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.100
A very long time...

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.550
I never thought I'd see someone,

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:03.230
since I became an insect, 
who could match my blade so well.

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:07.820
You will entertain me a good deal.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.020
Shut up!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.160
His arms extended!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.200
He's only playing with me...

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:30.360
Is that all you've got, rat?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.300
I still have more tricks.

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.180
I don't understand.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.940
Shogun Yoshimune ordered me to protect

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.320
so I had not planned to say anything.

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:54.560
But why did you choose that 
man to accompany you?

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.540
He doesn't focus or pay attention.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.700
He allows his feelings to interfere with his task.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:08.310
As a samurai, he acts like a child.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.420
This is wrong. Very wrong.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.630
Take this...

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.780
Go, my servants!

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.050
<i>Crane Wing Egg Formation!</i>

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.050
<b>Crane Wing Egg Formation</b>

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.470
Eggs from his back?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:28.690
He is not an appropriate choice to protect you.

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:31.590
Why did you select him, Princess?

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.960
He was the most suited to the task.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.750
Tsukishima is mistaken as to my identity.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:43.950
And I wished to make some memories, as well.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.500
This way, Princess.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:59.540
I, Oooka Tadasuke, do not 
understand your feelings.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:03.810
But that does not change my obedience.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:23.740
Tsukishima, the gate is open!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.500
Come quickly!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:26.850
Right!

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.490
I will not let you escape.

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:36.170
This is the end!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.580
There's no way to block all three attacks!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:39.680
Tsukishima!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.190
He caught one in his teeth?

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:54.710
Take this!

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:56.630
This is for the people you killed.

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:00.910
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:04.250
I have failed!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.910
Well done, rat.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.540
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Strike!</i>

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:36.730
Curse you.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:40.780
I've let the rats escape...

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:52.020
It seems to be coming along well, my lord.

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.080
Indeed.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.960
So, Jinpachi, is what you say true?

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.500
Yes, three rats have entered Kishuu.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:03.530
And they seemed to know of us.

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:07.560
They called us "Insect-men."

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:11.780
They call us Insect-men?

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:14.810
I never put any thought into our name, 
but that's amusing.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.230
By the way, Jinpachi...

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.960
How long will you bow your head?

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:23.230
I failed at the pass.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:27.480
I cannot possibly face you.

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:31.580
Nedzu is always so stiff.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:37.210
<i>So those who entered my province 
referred to them as Insect-men?</i>

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:41.530
<i>Only a few use that name.</i>

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.720
<i>In other words, the Princess has entered Kishuu?</i>

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:51.310
Munenao-dono, how will you atone for this?

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.480
Atone?

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:56.990
Our presence in Kishuu is a secret.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.860
I told you to let none pass.

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:03.420
This means the promise 
you made has been broken,

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:06.740
and we must kill all the citizens of Kishuu.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:09.740
That's insane!

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:14.120
Then bring me the heads of these rats...

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:18.290
Use every single citizen of Kishuu

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:23.070
to bring us the corpses of the rats 
that called us the Insect-men!

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.050 --> 00:23:03.510
Miss, I can't wait to rest after our 
long journey. How about you?

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:04.150
Indeed.

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:05.830
Ideally, at a hot spring!

00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:06.540
Indeed.

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:08.150
And there's a mixed-gender one right here!

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:09.090
Very wrong.

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:11.090
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Sanada Yukimura's Trap! 
Caught in a Net!!</b>

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:12.590
Sanada Yukimura's Trap.

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:14.000
Caught in a Net.
